# Mission to evidence loop

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  Q[Mission question] --> R[Requirement contract]
  R --> O[Observable at declared support]
  O --> P[Planetary reference]
  O --> E[Earth terrain unit]
  P --> C[Comparison]
  E --> C
  C --> G[Transfer-gap ledger]
  G --> S[Draft study protocol]
  S --> X[Authorized field/simulation outcome]
  X --> U[Update transfer evidence]
  U --> R
```

The arrows are not claims of completed v0.1 capability. The first release implements the loop through draft protocol; the outcome/update loop is the post-release product thesis.
